NAME: Weekly call insights
OWNER: Call Bank
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: Every Friday at 11:07 AM
MILESTONE: 3
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Dan says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/spike-team/context/routines-on.md. If "Weekly call insights" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", write "Weekly call insights: not switched on" to this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/ and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Dan only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/spike-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md is missing, write NO_CLIENT_SOURCE to the log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, write "no change" and stop.
Run record: end every run with one line in this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/: the time, "Weekly call insights", and done, no change, not switched on, blocked (why) or failed (why), with counts. If you stopped at the switch check or the isolation guard, the line you wrote there is this run's record; don't add a second.

From this week's notes in /workspace/spike-team/vault/Calls/ and vault/Sales/Objections.md: top objections and how often, grade trend per closer, the best call of the week, and calls that seem to be missing a recording (closers with EODs showing live calls but no filed call). Send it to Dan only and save it to /workspace/spike-team/vault/Sales/Call insights/<friday>.md.
